    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Quarreling couple choose (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Quarreling couple choose to divorce. Tap the passport in hand. Short-haired couple choose to get married.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
