      <span class="step-num">Step 19</span>
      <strong>Tap the speaker in the upper right corner when the…</strong>
      <p>Tap the speaker in the upper right corner when the white puppy is present.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 103 shows “Alley Danger”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Help the girl break free.”, this is that scene, 12 moves in order:</p>
